[[File:S2E37 Cerberus mauling Albion.png|thumb|Ceberus pins down [[Albion]] while two of its heads tear him apart]]
Cerberus has three heads with powerful jaws, sharp teeth and claws. This Titan is capable of moving at great speed to attack. Its bites can cause tremendous amounts of damage, as when it took out [[Vigilante]] and [[Albion]] in multiple bites. Cerberus is also quite resistant to attacks, as when it was stabbed in the chest by Vigilante with no effect. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}} It can also fires blasts of flames from its mouth to take down enemies. {{source|Cerberus (comic)}}

